# Nothing here any more.
#
# The site used to read Whoop numbers from the life-os API at runtime. It does not: the
# numbers are committed to data/whoop/latest.json and refreshed once a day by
# .github/workflows/daily-snapshot.yml, so the Worker needs no credentials.
#
# The only build-time variables that matter are documented in README.md and CLAUDE.md:
#
#   VITE_CONVEX_URL   /baby renders without live vote data
#   VITE_CF_IMAGES    images are served untransformed
#
# `LIFEOS_API_URL` and `LIFEOS_WEB_TOKEN` live in GitHub (repository variable + secret) for
# the refresh job alone. See scripts/refresh-life-os.ts.
